  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Potable Water Sector Reform Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Apoyo Reforma Sector Agua Potable</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM INCLUDES THE STRENGTHENING OF REGULATORY ENTITIES AND THE IMPROVEMENT OF SERVICE PROVISION THROUGH GREATER PARTICIPATION OF THE PRIVATE SECTOR. THE PROGRAM WILL FINANCE OPERATIONAL IMPROVEMENTS, REHABILITATION WORKS AND SERVICE EXPANSION (WATER SUPPLY AND SEWERAGE NETWORKS), ESPECIALLY TO LOW INCOME NEIGHBORHOODS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
